00:47:53.560 --> 00:47:56.660
To use technical terms, there are three kinds
of late life history.

00:47:56.660 --> 00:48:03.010
One of them is no senescence basically or
no sort of classic biological aging.

00:48:03.010 --> 00:48:07.310
And the other is what we call semelparity
that means giving birth once and another is

00:48:07.310 --> 00:48:09.320
iteroparity that means giving birth multiple
times.

00:48:09.320 --> 00:48:16.280
So in some plants and some animals if you
do the right things evolutionarily or the

00:48:16.280 --> 00:48:20.090
environment changes the right way you will
find individuals die upon reproduction.

00:48:20.090 --> 00:48:24.100
So dandelions do this and a lot of annual
plants do this.

00:48:24.100 --> 00:48:31.850
Pacific salmon species do this, where the
rainbow trout, which is actually a salmon,

00:48:31.850 --> 00:48:32.970
doesn't.

00:48:32.970 --> 00:48:39.100
And so very quickly in evolutionarily terms,
you can turn a species from being an iteroparity,

00:48:39.100 --> 00:48:45.470
it is giving birth multiple times and then
having a senescent phase and dying, to dying

00:48:45.470 --> 00:48:46.470
upon reproduction.

00:48:46.470 --> 00:48:49.230
And you do that one of the ways you can do
that in fruit flies which normally are what

00:48:49.230 --> 00:48:54.240
we call iteroparous you can make them semelparous
and force evolutionary experiments in the

00:48:54.240 --> 00:48:56.710
laboratory by restricting their food.

00:48:56.710 --> 00:49:03.070
So there's an advantage to having post reproductive
individuals die very quickly under that special

00:49:03.070 --> 00:49:05.320
circumstance and you can find a cause of death.

00:49:05.320 --> 00:49:10.790
For example in salmon they get massive production
of corticosteroids from their adrenal glands

00:49:10.790 --> 00:49:17.180
which kills them after they start, after they
spawn, upon going up a stream.

00:49:17.180 --> 00:49:22.160
You remove their gonads and their adrenals
and they'll live twenty years instead of two

00:49:22.160 --> 00:49:23.160
to four years.

00:49:23.160 --> 00:49:24.160
So it can happen.

